    <item>
      <title>Agent之战：从编码框架到可视化平台，OpenAI AgentKit如何重塑AI工作流生态</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/agentopenai-agentkitai-20251008011006787-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 08 Oct 2025 01:10:06 +0800</pubDate>
